<p class="ah-prose-p">But the AI SDK comes with dozens and dozens of <a href="https://ai-sdk.dev/providers/ai-sdk-providers" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="ah-prose-a">different providers</a> that you can potentially hook into, including, if you want to, using local models.</p>
