 Up a Model\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Using a model requires doing two things:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Installing the relevant package\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"Adding the correct environment variable to your \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\".env\",\"className\":\"ah-code-inline\"}],\" file\"]}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-numbers\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Let's look at the packages we have installed:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}],\"\\n\",[[\"$\",\"$L5b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":[\"4782351197561362667\"]}],\"$L5c\"],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"For each provider, you need a specific environment variable:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}],\"\\n\",[[\"$\",\"$L5b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":[\"1134722980751639125\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L5d\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"children\":\"Provider\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"children\":\"Environment Variable\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":\"OpenAI\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"OPENAI_API_KEY\",\"className\":\"ah-code-inline\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":\"Google\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY\",\"className\":\"ah-code-inline\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":\"Anthropic\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\",\"className\":\"ah-code-inline\"}]}]]}]]}]]}]}]],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"$L5a\",null,{\"level\":2,\"children\":\"Instantiating a Model\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"You can then instantiate the model by just calling this \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"openai\",\"className\":\"ah-code-inline\"}],\" or \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"google\",\"className\":\"ah-code-inline\"}],\" or \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"anthropic\",\"className\":\"ah-code-inline\"}],\" here:\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}],\"\\n\",[[\"$\",\"$L5b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$4e:content:16:0:props:moduleIds\"}],\"$L5e\"],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"I'm console logging the model down below just so we can see what it looks like. And we can see that you get an OpenAI responses language model.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You also get autocomplete on the model ID, so you can see all of the available options.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"$L5a\",null,{\"level\":2,\"children\":\"Default Model for the Course\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Now, I've chosen Google as our default option. So most of the code in the exercises, by default, will be using Gemini models from Google. The reasons for that are:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"They are extremely cheap\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"There is even a free tier to just get an API key and get started\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"They run very, very quickly\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"They are good enough for our purposes\"}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-bullets\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"However, if you want to use OpenAI and Anthropic for your models, all you'll need to do is just swap them out before you start the exercise. If you want to do it across the whole repo, you can probably do a pretty smart find and replace too.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L5f\",\"\\n\",\"$L60\",\"\\n\",\"$L61\"],\"frontmatter\":{}}\n62:I[656577,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/00osd5